{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790370180, "covers_from": "2026-09-25T21:03:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-25T21:04:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790370240, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-25T21:03:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24169, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "環境", "content": "搬來雙連站周邊大約三四年，從去年開始陽台開始遭受老鼠侵襲，老鼠問題是真的，國民黨說是南鼠北送，超不爽", "display_name": "大同代表 No.24,169", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T21:03:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50981, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你當選市長，勞工退休金未依據勞基法辦理，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.50,981", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T21:03:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 51598, "sprite_key": "turtle_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "食安", "content": "國中營養午餐可增加自費，讓小孩吃的營養。", "display_name": "信義代表 No.51,598", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T21:03:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16207, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北市很有錢，但為什麼公立停車場貴成這樣，連帶週邊跟著漲價，結果車輛亂停路邊，機車也沒地方停！！！", "display_name": "北投代表 No.16,207", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-25T21:03:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 876, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "現在有好多電動自行車 輪子都好大，就這樣騎在人行道上騎很快很危險 建議開始納入管理，不然出事來不及了", "display_name": "大安代表 No.876", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 50981, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.50,981", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 51598, "sprite_key": "turtle_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.51,598", "district": "xinyi", "is_re